<title>USA: Angstrom FY96 net loss widens.</title>
<headline>Angstrom FY96 net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>For fiscal year ended December 31:</p>
<p>				1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary loss	 $0.03     loss	 $0.02</p>
<p> Net loss		 704,413     loss     483,363</p>
<p> Revs		     869,829		1,050,281</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	   n/a			n/a</p>
<p>NOTE: Results for 1996 Q4 were not available.</p>
<p>Full company name is Angstrom Technologies Inc.</p>
